Package: libncnn1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Pre-Depends:
 ${misc:Pre-Depends},
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: high-performance neural network inference framework (shared lib)
 ncnn is a high-performance neural network inference computing framework
 optimized for mobile and embedded platforms. It has no third-party runtime
 dependencies and provides ARM NEON assembly-level optimizations with runtime
 CPU dispatch, which makes it well suited for on-device inference on
 Raspberry Pi class hardware.
 .
 This package provides the shared library (CPU inference only; the Vulkan GPU
 path is not built).

Package: libncnn-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends:
 libncnn1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: high-performance neural network inference framework (dev files)
 ncnn is a high-performance neural network inference computing framework
 optimized for mobile and embedded platforms. It has no third-party runtime
 dependencies and provides ARM NEON assembly-level optimizations with runtime
 CPU dispatch, which makes it well suited for on-device inference on
 Raspberry Pi class hardware.
 .
 This package provides the headers, CMake package config and pkg-config files
 for building against libncnn.
